# Configure signal generator 1 and switch it on.
#
# Ref.SG1.Settings takes (Frequency, Amplitude, Phase, SigType). The binary type of
# Frequency differs between the two demo builds (U32 in gate-demo-1.0.0, U16 in
# gate-demo-1.1.0), so bytecode compiled for one build is wrong for the other.
log("signal_setup: configuring SG1")
Ref.SG1.Settings(100, 2.5, 0.0, Ref.SignalType.SINE)
Ref.SG1.Toggle()
log("signal_setup: done")
